; Exports of the dxgi.dll proxy, for the GNU (MinGW/zig) build only: build_host_linux.sh.
; MSVC exports every #[no_mangle] fn by itself. The MinGW auto-export drops the names
; that its own libdxgi import library defines (CreateDXGIFactory*, DXGIGetDebugInterface1),
; and a dxgi proxy without CreateDXGIFactory stops the game from starting. Keep in step with lib.rs.
LIBRARY dxgi
EXPORTS
    CreateDXGIFactory
    CreateDXGIFactory1
    CreateDXGIFactory2
    DXGID3D10CreateDevice
    DXGID3D10CreateLayeredDevice
    DXGID3D10GetLayeredDeviceSize
    DXGID3D10RegisterLayers
    DXGIGetDebugInterface1
    DXGIReportAdapterConfiguration
